1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 9=

15
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,760
Wasn't I consumed by fire poison?

16
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:22,150
Why am I completely fine?

17
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:30,920
The impurities inside me

18
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:33,280
have been cleansed by the alchemy fire.

19
00:01:35,950 --> 00:01:36,870
Time to completely transform myself,

20
00:01:37,230 --> 00:01:38,870
renew my meridians,
and cleanse my marrow.

21
00:01:45,430 --> 00:01:46,400
Meridian and Marrow Cleansing Pill,

22
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:49,070
I hope you can help me.

23
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:08,840
(What a horrible smell, ugly freak!)

24
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:10,800
(Stay away from us!)

25
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:12,400
(Go check yourself in the mirror!)

26
00:02:12,470 --> 00:02:12,960
(Get lost!)

27
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:13,870
(Get out!)

28
00:02:14,190 --> 00:02:14,960
(Get lost!)

29
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:19,870
Senior Brother Zhao,

30
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:22,680
actually, I...

31
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:24,400
I like you.

32
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,750
I only care about you

33
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,120
as a fellow disciple.

34
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,190
If anything more got mixed in,

35
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:32,680
it would change what we have.

36
00:02:33,030 --> 00:02:33,800
Zhao Feiyang,

37
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:36,120
I'll make you regret this!

38
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:42,310
♪My heart set on crossing
the boundless sea♪

39
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:49,710
♪A sudden storm shattered my mast♪

40
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:56,390
♪I found myself stranded in the abyss♪
(Spirit Awakening Realm, Stage 7)

41
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:03,470
♪I sail on and on,
yet can't leave this longing behind♪

42
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:10,950
♪I've traveled far and wide,
yet the past still follows me♪

43
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,870
♪These wounds upon my skin♪

44
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:18,630
♪Are how the years have crowned me♪

45
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:25,150
♪Through fading lights,
I finally see it clear♪

46
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:30,870
♪The lost shore where I once stood♪

47
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,840
I'm no longer that clown

48
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:34,470
everyone used to despise.

49
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,150
Zhao Feiyang!

50
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,150
Didn't you make it through?

51
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:48,710
What a pity.

52
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:49,870
You'll never

53
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:51,710
get to see this moment.

54
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,000
The Alchemy Hall is open.

55
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:13,470
It's time to say goodbye to my old self.

56
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:31,510
(I actually survived?)

57
00:04:41,830 --> 00:04:43,120
What happened to the fire poison in me?

58
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,830
My Dao Bone turned it
into spiritual power

59
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:48,240
and stored it inside me.

60
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:58,860
(Spirit Burst Realm, Stage 3)

61
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,310
Three years ago,

62
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,510
I was only at Stage 5 of the
Spirit Awakening Realm.

63
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,510
Now, after rebuilding from ruin,

64
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,120
I actually broke straight through
to the Spirit Burst Realm.

65
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,240
Heavens,

66
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:12,000
you're finally on my side for once.

67
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:20,780
(Heavenly Sword Sect)

68
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,870
The Alchemy Hall opens today.

69
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:26,190
I wonder what level
Zhao Feiyang and Cuihua will reach

70
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,390
when they come out.

71
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:29,870
They're both geniuses.

72
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,680
Of course they'll be extraordinary.

73
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:33,720
I'm so envious.

74
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,270
In a world that worships strength,

75
00:05:35,870 --> 00:05:37,390
only geniuses

76
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,000
get this much attention.

77
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,800
(What genius?)

78
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:44,390
(They're nothing but ashes
in there now.)

79
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,560
(So they did tamper with it.)

80
00:05:47,190 --> 00:05:48,720
(The genius in the Heavenly Sword Sect)

81
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,120
(can only be me.)

82
00:05:57,870 --> 00:05:59,480
Holy Maiden,
I didn't expect that in just two months,

83
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:01,870
you'd refine the divine-grade Dao Bone

84
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,750
and make it your own. Impressive.

85
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,830
And your cultivation

86
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,720
has soared as well.

87
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,390
The heavens favor me.

88
00:06:08,830 --> 00:06:10,680
I've reached Stage 1 of the
Spirit Burst Realm.

89
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,000
Good heavens!

90
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,360
Stage 1 of the Spirit Burst Realm?

91
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:14,310
And you're only in your twenties?

92
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:16,310
There are very few like you
on the Shenwu Continent.

93
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:18,000
Truly a remarkable young talent.

94
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:19,070
Zhao Feiyang

95
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,190
really is blind.

96
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:21,310
He actually...

97
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,040
Elder Wang,

98
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,630
I don't want to discuss this now.

99
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:25,870
My fault.

100
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:26,870
My fault.

101
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:28,480
You really shouldn't have brought it up.

102
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:29,720
I heard

103
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:32,190
a peerless genius has emerged
in the sect.

104
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:34,680
I came to meet her today.

105
00:06:36,510 --> 00:06:38,600
Holy Maiden,
you certainly get news quickly.

106
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:39,950
She's in the Alchemy Hall.

107
00:06:40,190 --> 00:06:41,480
She should be out soon.

108
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,680
(The Alchemy Hall's been open
for a while.)

109
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,360
(Why hasn't she come out yet?)

110
00:06:47,510 --> 00:06:47,950
Oh,

111
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:49,510
Zhao Feiyang is in there too.

112
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,430
He hasn't come out either.

113
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,040
Zhao Feiyang's in there too?

114
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:54,750
He...

115
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,510
With his low cultivation
and unranked Dao Bone,

116
00:06:58,190 --> 00:06:59,750
he's only asking for trouble.

117
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,310
Will they be okay?

118
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:03,800
Cuihua is definitely fine.

119
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,720
With her divine-grade Dao Bone

120
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:07,950
and the Snow Ward I gave her,

121
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,480
the fire poison in there can't hurt her.

122
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,270
As for Zhao Feiyang...

123
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:13,720
It's hard to say.

124
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:17,510
I hope everything goes well.

125
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:40,390
It's Cuihua!

126
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,560
She's so beautiful!

127
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,560
That...

128
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,560
that's Cuihua?

129
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:01,720
How...

130
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,270
how is she still alive?

131
00:08:03,390 --> 00:08:03,950
Oh my!

132
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,310
She's renewed her meridians
and completely transformed.

133
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,600
She's nothing like her old self.

134
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:09,680
My girl,

135
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,190
you're finally out.

136
00:08:12,310 --> 00:08:12,950
Thank heavens!

137
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:14,120
Sect Master,

138
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,630
your goddaughter's become so beautiful.

139
00:08:15,750 --> 00:08:16,310
Just look at her!

140
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:20,630
Thank you, Father, and all three Elders,
for your guidance.

141
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,600
We're family. Please, get up.

142
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,480
All disciples, heed my command.

143
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,160
From this day forward,

144
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,750
my goddaughter Cuihua

145
00:08:32,910 --> 00:08:35,270
shall be the Young Sect Master.

146
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,600
Greetings, Young Sect Master!

147
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,670
Greetings, Young Sect Master!

148
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,670
Where's Zhao Feiyang?

149
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:51,720
Oh, right.

150
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:52,720
Where's Zhao Feiyang?

151
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:53,670
We were too happy,

152
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:54,670
and forgot about Zhao Feiyang.

153
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,870
Wasn't he in there with you
at the Alchemy Hall?

154
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:57,630
Where is he?

155
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,200
Right.

156
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,390
Where's Zhao Feiyang?

157
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,120
He...

158
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,000
he didn't make it.

159
00:09:05,630 --> 00:09:06,200
What?

160
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,270
(Thank goodness, Zhao Feiyang is dead.)

161
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,390
(Though Cuihua's now
the Young Sect Master,)

162
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,720
(she's still a woman.)

163
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:15,270
(If I can win her over,)

164
00:09:15,550 --> 00:09:16,550
(that'd be even better.)

165
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,670
Looks like he wasn't so lucky.

166
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,790
Our work paid off.

167
00:09:21,550 --> 00:09:22,080
Impossible.

168
00:09:22,630 --> 00:09:23,750
With Zhao Feiyang's resolve,

169
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:24,870
the fire poison at the Alchemy Hall

170
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:26,360
couldn't have defeated him so easily.

171
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,320
Yes.

172
00:09:27,550 --> 00:09:28,790
Everything was fine at first.

173
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:30,030
But halfway through,

174
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,120
the fire poison suddenly ran wild,

175
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,080
and grew several times stronger.

176
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:34,270
Even I...

177
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,720
barely made it through.

178
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:37,360
The fire poison surged?

179
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,000
How is that possible?

180
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,390
The alchemy fire's always been stable.

181
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,480
It couldn't suddenly surge like that.

182
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,120
My girl,

183
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:45,150
are you sure?

184
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:47,510
Yes.

185
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,080
Absolutely.

186
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:51,600
Sect Master, something's off.

187
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:53,790
Outrageous!

188
00:09:53,870 --> 00:09:56,480
Is someone jealous that our sect
has produced a genius

189
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:57,630
and trying to kill her?

190
00:09:58,390 --> 00:09:58,910
Who is it?

191
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,600
If I find them,

192
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,550
no matter who they are,

193
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,270
I'll destroy them!

194
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,630
Thankfully, my girl is unharmed.

195
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:13,750
Unfortunately,

196
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:16,270
Zhao Feiyang didn't make it.

197
00:10:17,030 --> 00:10:18,480
Let this be a lesson to us all.

198
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:20,200
We must know our limits.

199
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,440
Don't force yourself

200
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:22,910
to do what you can't handle.

201
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:25,550
We'll heed your words, Sect Master!

202
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,600
Sect Master,

203
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:30,480
may I go into the Alchemy Hall
and take a look?

204
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,270
Holy Maiden,

205
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,790
you want to check
if Zhao Feiyang's still alive?

206
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,320
I don't think there's any need.

207
00:10:35,790 --> 00:10:38,910
He's probably been reduced to ashes.

208
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,080
I saw with my own eyes

209
00:10:40,550 --> 00:10:41,790
that he fell into the flames.

210
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:44,240
(Why does my heart ache?)

211
00:10:45,270 --> 00:10:47,200
(Is it because the clue
to the Nine Heavens Codex)

212
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:48,750
(ends with him?)

213
00:10:50,910 --> 00:10:51,390
All right.

214
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:06,720
What...

215
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:08,120
He's out!

216
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:08,870
Yeah!

217
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,150
Zhao Feiyang!

218
00:11:21,550 --> 00:11:22,360
He... he...

219
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,840
How is he still alive?

220
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,390
Is he human or a ghost?

221
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,200
Can a ghost stand in sunlight?

222
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:33,550
(The Nether Hall couldn't kill him.)

223
00:11:33,870 --> 00:11:35,750
(The fire poison couldn't either.)

224
00:11:36,510 --> 00:11:38,320
(Does he have nine lives?)

225
00:11:40,150 --> 00:11:40,670
Sect Master,

226
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,000
the fire poison in there
suddenly surged out of control.

227
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:43,790
I suspect

228
00:11:43,910 --> 00:11:45,200
someone tampered with it.

229
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,870
The Alchemy Hall lies at the heart
of the Heavenly Sword Sect.

230
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,200
It must have been one of us.

231
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,200
Please get to the bottom of this,
Sect Master.

232
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,080
I'm aware of the matter.

233
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,030
I'll find whoever did this.

234
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:57,960
Where is Cuihua now?

235
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,030
Is she all right?

236
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:01,480
Isn't Cuihua

237
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:03,200
right in front of you?

238
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:07,600
You...

239
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,200
you're Cuihua?

240
00:12:19,790 --> 00:12:20,630
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
You don't recognize me?

241
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:21,910
Oh, no.

242
00:12:22,150 --> 00:12:24,200
Cuihua had a thing for Zhao Feiyang.

243
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:25,270
During their years as servant disciples,

244
00:12:25,390 --> 00:12:26,440
they were practically inseparable.

245
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,550
So Zhao Feiyang gets another chance
with someone out of his league?

246
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:29,200
Yeah.

247
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:30,870
The Holy Maiden still can't forget him,

248
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,240
and now even Cuihua...

249
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,270
How is this brat so lucky?

250
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,510
If I'd known

251
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,240
Cuihua had such potential,

252
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:39,550
I'd have treated her better.

253
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,080
Don't be so sure.

254
00:12:42,390 --> 00:12:43,670
I don't think it's that simple.

255
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:44,600
Senior Brother Lin,

256
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:45,960
what do you mean?

257
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:48,000
The strong only admire the strong.

258
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,840
But Zhao Feiyang now...

259
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:52,480
It's really you.

260
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,150
Looks like you've renewed your meridians
and cleansed your marrow.

261
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,080
You've completely transformed.

262
00:12:55,270 --> 00:12:56,200
Congrats, Cuihua.

263
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:56,720
Stop!

264
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,080
Are we that close?

265
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:10,210
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

266
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:12,610
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

267
00:13:13,180 --> 00:13:16,730
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

268
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:21,290
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

269
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:24,610
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

270
00:13:25,450 --> 00:13:28,120
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

271
00:13:28,340 --> 00:13:31,740
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

272
00:13:31,820 --> 00:13:35,550
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

273
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:39,590
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

274
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:42,980
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

275
00:13:43,780 --> 00:13:46,300
♪With this flesh and soul♪

276
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:49,850
♪I shall forge a new age♪

277
